Visualizations Produced
🥧 Pie Charts

Example Disease Pie Chart — demonstrates a simple categorical pie visualization.

Proportion of Upper Values by Month (2022) — displays how much each month contributes to the total upper values.

📊 Stacked Bar Chart

Shows upper and lower values stacked together for each year (2022, 2023, 2024).

Allows visual comparison across months and years simultaneously.

🔁 Seasonal Decomposition

Uses seasonal_decompose() from statsmodels to break down the 2022 upper values into:

Trend – the long-term movement of data.

Seasonality – repeating monthly patterns.

Residual – random noise or irregular fluctuations.
